も高い利益率を確保できる見込みとなりました。これらを踏まえ、営業利益、経常利益及び親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益をそれぞれ上記のとおり修正いたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2025年5月12日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 110, "110.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 110, "110.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 96, "96.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 96, "96.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は、株主の皆様への利益還元を経営上の重要政策のひとつとして認識しており、現在及び今後の事業収益をベースに、将来の事業展開に必要な内部留保を確保しつつ、安定した配当を継続していくことを基本方針とし、当期純利益の35％を配当額の目途に(配当性向35％)、各期の業績に応じた配当を実施してまいります。この度の業績予想の修正を受け、2026年３月期の期末配当を2025年５月12日公表の１株当たり100円から10円増配し、１株当たり110円に修正することといたしました。なお、本件につきましては、2026年６月下旬開催予定の第17回定時株主総会に付議する予定であります。(注) 上記の予想につきましては、現時点で入手可能な情報に基づき判断したものであり、実際の業績は今後の様々な要因によって予想数値と異なる可能性があります。以", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}